<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager WGZ Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK HANNOVER</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.625     MATURITY  **03.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100	 LISTING    HANNOVER  PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    **CALL 03.JUL.98 WHEN COUPON CHANGES TO 9.5 PCT MINUS</p>
<p>		12M LIBOR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
